 "type_reasons": [
  "Damodaran stage high_growth (computed): revenue CAGR FY2021-FY2026 67.2%; FY2026 growth 65.5%; latest quarter (Q2 FY2027) +105.9% y/y at a 66.2% operating margin; trailing-4-quarter growth 83.4% (SEC companyfacts). Annual rules alone said mature_growth (large, profitable dividend payer); the quarter-momentum rule moved it to high_growth: here an ACCELERATION on an already huge base, not a turnaround.",
