  "Cyclical watch (flag, not a type): in FY2023 revenue was flat (+0.2%) while operating margin fell from 37.3% to 15.7%; semiconductor demand has turned before in NVDA's own history. The classifier's cyclical rule did not fire (no annual revenue drop > 10%). Whether the AI data-center demand is structural or cyclical is the central question for Understand (business lane decides forecast_options.cyclical with evidence).",
  "Acquisition flag FY2026: goodwill rose from 5.188B to 20.832B (> 10% of prior total assets); the classifier measured growth without that year. The transaction behind it is NOT identified in this phase (gap); revenue growth looks organic but must be confirmed from the 10-K business-combination note.",
  "Operating margin 60.4% FY2026 (from 27.2% FY2021); operating cash flow 47.6% of revenue; capex light (6.04B FY2026); buybacks 40.1B FY2026.",
